{
  "app_id": 3375990,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Build, run, and grow your very own PC cafe. PC Cafe Simulator is a management simulation game set in a Korean PC cafe—an internet cafe built for PC gaming. Become the owner of a PC cafe and grow it from a small shop into a popular place filled with customers. Play solo at your own pace, or team up with friends in co-op multiplayer for up to 8 players. Build Your Own PC Cafe Purchase the furniture and equipment you need to run your PC cafe and decorate it your way. Use customization features to create an interior with the atmosphere you want. Cook and Serve a Variety of Food No Korean PC cafe is complete without food! Cook the food your customers order and serve it to them yourself. Keep your customers satisfied with delicious meals and increase your sales. Order Supplies and Manage Your Inventory Order the supplies you need for your PC cafe and receive deliveries. Manage the inventory needed to keep your store running. Stock up on the food your customers want and run your store efficiently. Realistic Customers and Staff Customers will visit your PC cafe, sit down, play games, order food, and leave reviews based on their experience. If there are no customers, head outside and attract passersby to bring more people into your PC cafe. Rain or Shine The sun rises and sets as time passes, and the weather changes from day to day. Deal With Troublemakers Yourself Some customers may run away without paying or cause a scene. Deal with them yourself using a broom! Play Alone or With Friends Run your PC cafe at your own pace in single-player, or split up roles with friends in co-op multiplayer for up to 8 players and manage the store more efficiently. When you need a break, relax by listening to music or watching videos. You can enjoy them while working in your store too! After closing time, buy fireworks and enjoy a fireworks show with your friends! Create fun moments using a variety of emotes! If one of your lazy friends is not doing their job, teach them a lesson with your broom!"
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
    "en": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, run, and grow your very own PC cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC Cafe Simulator is a management simulation game set in a Korean PC cafe—an internet cafe built for PC gaming. Become the owner of a PC cafe and grow it from a small shop into a popular place filled with customers. Play solo at your own pace, or team up with friends in co-op multiplayer for up to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own PC Cafe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/8895c3c6f386bc51ca15b40d144fcc1a.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/8895c3c6f386bc51ca15b40d144fcc1a.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/8895c3c6f386bc51ca15b40d144fcc1a.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase the furniture and equipment you need to run your PC cafe and decorate it your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/6a0a6376559586b844e21a242b8fd1c3.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/6a0a6376559586b844e21a242b8fd1c3.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/6a0a6376559586b844e21a242b8fd1c3.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></s