_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/af9306035edf4395f0639d7698381317.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/af9306035edf4395f0639d7698381317.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/af9306035edf4395f0639d7698381317.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the inventory needed to keep your store running. Stock up on the food your customers want and run your store efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Customers and Staff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/8e6da6fd90bf21bff4cc920f013f2a41.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/8e6da6fd90bf21bff4cc920f013f2a41.webm?t=1793152808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/8e6da6fd90bf21bff4cc920f013f2a41.mp4?t=1793152808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will visit your PC cafe, sit down, play games, order food, and leave reviews based on their experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/810d0a857862f5cb519faccc4b1386a5.poster.avif?t=1793152808\" width=1170 h